<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova lowers discount rate to 20 pct from 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldova lowers discount rate to 20 pct from 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank reduced its official discount rate to 20 percent annually from 21 percent effective March 17, a National Bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new rate was used at a credit funds auction on Monday, when eight banks borrowed a total of 50.00 million lei ($10.75 million) from the National Bank.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
